@HostAddress = http://localhost:5148
@Token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@ProjectId = YOUR_PROJECT_ID_HERE
@ApiKey = YOUR_API_KEY_HERE

### ===== 1. SIGNUP & LOGIN =====

### Register (public - no auth)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@handly.dev",
  "password": "Admin123!",
  "fullName": "Admin User"
}

### Login → save token from response
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@handly.dev",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### ===== 2. PROJECT MANAGEMENT (JWT) =====

### Create Project → save projectId and apiKey
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

{
  "name": "My App",
  "slug": "my-app"
}

### List My Projects
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Get Current Project Info
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects/current
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
X-Project-Id: {{ProjectId}}

### List Project Members
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/projects/current/members
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
X-Project-Id: {{ProjectId}}

### Invite Member to Project
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/projects/current/members
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
X-Project-Id: {{ProjectId}}

{
  "email": "viewer@handly.dev",
  "role": "Viewer"
}

### ===== 3. ENDPOINTS (JWT + Project) =====

### Create Endpoint
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/endpoints
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
X-Project-Id: {{ProjectId}}

{
  "name": "Test Webhook",
  "url": "https://httpbin.org/post",
  "httpMethod": "POST",
  "timeoutSeconds": 30,
  "maxAttempts": 5
}

### List Endpoints
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/endpoints
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
X-Project-Id: {{ProjectId}}

### ===== 4. DELIVERIES (Machine - API Key) =====

### Create Delivery
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "endpointId": "ENDPOINT_ID_HERE",
  "idempotencyKey": "lead-123-insider",
  "payload": {
    "leadId": 12345,
    "name": "Test Lead"
  }
}

### Get Delivery (API Key)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/deliveries/DELIVERY_ID_HERE
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Get Delivery Attempts (API Key)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/deliveries/DELIVERY_ID_HERE/attempts
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### ===== 5. DELIVERIES (Dashboard - JWT) =====

### Get Delivery (JWT)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/deliveries/DELIVERY_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
X-Project-Id: {{ProjectId}}

### Get Delivery Attempts (JWT)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/deliveries/DELIVERY_ID_HERE/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
X-Project-Id: {{ProjectId}}
